      "statement": "For the true source RGO posterior standardized using the same internally produced measurable stationary proximal point, produce the actual relative Gaussian density, positive partition, C2 square root and all L2/entropy/gradient domains with the exact1/4 energy, for every eta(s)>0.",
      "formula": "r_s=(x\\mapsto\\eta_s^{-1/2}(x-p_s))_\\#R_s=q_s\\gamma,\\quad q_s=e^{-\\rho_s}/Z_s,\\quad\\nabla\\log q_s=-\\nabla\\rho_s,\\quad\\int\\|\\nabla\\sqrt{q_s}\\|^2d\\gamma=\\tfrac14\\int\\|\\nabla\\rho_s\\|^2dr_s.",
      "boundary": "Actual positive Gaussian relative-density and classical C2/L2 square-root/entropy/log-gradient/Dirichlet=Fisher/4 domains, genuinely consumed by the source standardized true RGO. No Gaussian LSI/T2/KL weak representative/Sobolev adapter/W2/bias/fullLemma/main/work/composition credit. Focused3748 passed with E0/L0 and actual eta2y3 posterior tests, standard3 axioms only. Independent proof/blind/source/commit review and integration pending; postmerge purification, renderedQA and Copy/Download remain open.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "title": "Reuse the true posterior and the same stationary point",
          "text": "The existing allpositive true standardized RGO producer constructs a measurable p with p+eta gradVp=y. Its literal affine pushforward r is the actual volume Gibbs law of norm²/2+rho, and its residual is C2 with gradientrho0=0 and Hessian0..eta. The residual value at0 is computed from its definition.",
          "formula": "p_s+\\eta_s\\nabla V(p_s)=y_s,\\quad r_s=(x\\mapsto\\eta_s^{-1/2}(x-p_s))_\\#R_s,\\quad\\rho_s(u)=V(p_s+\\sqrt{\\eta_s}u)-V(p_s)-\\sqrt{\\eta_s}\\langle\\nabla V(p_s),u\\rangle.",
          "lean": "StandardizedRGOPositionFisher.standardized_rgo_position_and_fisher"
