        {
          "title": "Apply the new density-domain producer to that actual residual",
          "text": "Instantiate the shared theorem with L=eta(s) and the same actual rho. Its canonical volume-law equality agrees with the true affine posterior law, yielding r=gamma.tilted(-rho), the actual normalized q, all square-root/entropy domains and actual probability. No output density or moment certificate is supplied.",
          "formula": "0<Z_s\\le1,\\quad q_s=e^{-\\rho_s}/Z_s,\\quad f_s=e^{-\\rho_s/2}/\\sqrt{Z_s},\\quad r_s=q_s\\gamma.",
          "lean": "GaussianSqrtDensityDomain.gaussian_sqrt_density_domain; actual htrue"
        },
