          "title": "Keep the same law in every derivative and energy conclusion",
          "text": "Transport only measure-valued fields along the proved actual-law equality. f_s and both gradients retain their literal representatives, and the exact1/4 energy uses that same true r_s. The measurable family is an authored extension; fixed parameters follow by Unit specialization. No eta upper cap or GaussianLSI/T2 conclusion is added.",
          "formula": "\\nabla f_s=-\\tfrac12f_s\\nabla\\rho_s,\\quad\\nabla\\log q_s=-\\nabla\\rho_s,\\quad\\int\\|\\nabla f_s\\|^2d\\gamma=\\frac14\\int\\|\\nabla\\rho_s\\|^2dr_s\\qquad(\\eta_s>0).",
